amba-virt-server (1.0.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Join the host network namespace before starting amba-virt-aaa.
    The image connector lives in the init netns, and a bind there
    requires CAP_NET_ADMIN. The namespace file is
    /etc/amba-virt/host-netns.

 -- Charles Chiou <cchiou@ambarella.com>  Fri, 09 Oct 2026 10:05:00 +0800

