amba-virt-server (1.0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Run the camera bring-up pipeline in amba-virt-server from a live
    /etc/amba-virt/camera.conf: firmware synchronization, early and late
    module lists, dsp_monitor_service, the 3A service, the sensor power
    GPIO, and the apply call into libamba-virt-camera.so.
  * amba-virt-backend gains BACKEND_OP_FIRMWARE_STORE and writes the
    firmware_class path node.
  * Package the Section 2.5 firmware set under /usr/lib/amba-virt/firmware
    and example configuration files.

 -- Charles Chiou <cchiou@ambarella.com>  Fri, 09 Oct 2026 12:30:00 +0800

